{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "API Postman 测试",
  "description": "监控 API 源代码变化并自动运行 Postman 集合测试以验证功能",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "fileEdited",
    "patterns": [
      "VRS/lemei/lemei-admin/src/main/java/**/*.java",
      "VRS/lemei/lemei-api/src/main/java/**/*.java",
      "VRS/lemei/lemei-system/src/main/java/**/*.java",
      "VRS/lemei/lemei-admin/src/main/resources/application*.yml",
      "VRS/lemei/lemei-api/src/main/resources/application*.yml",
      "VRS/lemei/pom.xml",
      "VRS/lemei/lemei-admin/pom.xml",
      "VRS/lemei/lemei-api/pom.xml"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "API 源代码或配置已修改。请检索 .postman.json 文件的内容。如果文件不存在或为空，请为 API 创建一个 Postman 集合。如果存在，获取集合 ID 并运行集合，显示结果并为任何错误提出修复建议。"
  }
}
